     "min": 10
    },
    {
     "text": "Shallow fry the taquitos in 1cm of hot oil, seam side down first, for 3 to 4 minutes, turning, until crisp. Drain on paper towel.",
     "min": 10
    },
    {
     "text": "Mix the sour cream with the lime zest and juice. Serve the taquitos with the lime crema, salsa verde, pickled onion and coriander.",
